                ],
                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "An input's config panel, reached from the chevron zone of its row on readout-volumes; full-screen per the 7\u2033 discipline. MIC drawn. Contents: the input's volume (same ThalA-scaled slider, dB), the #697 conditioning stage as four big 110-high toggles (HPF, HUM, EXPANDER, RESTORE \u2014 on = $accent-surface + $accent stroke, off = $bg-surface + $text-muted), and LISTENING TRACKS as read-only $bg-control pills (which tracks record this input \u2014 informational here, routing is edited on the main screen). BACK chip returns to the volume list; the 8 s inactivity auto-revert chain applies (panel \u2192 list \u2192 readout)."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
